# The witness co-signature verifier that lets a record earn EXTERNAL witness
# scope, and the test tools that check it. Compile with:
#   uv pip compile --no-header --python-version 3.12 requirements-witness.in -o requirements-witness.txt
# It is a separate environment, not a probity-verify extra: the verifier's
# witness module needs the jcs-admit Python binding, whose distribution name
# (probityai) is also the name of the probity command in this workspace, so the
# two cannot share one lock or one environment.
